{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/",
    "description": [
      "重新格式化给定的 NUMBER，未指定时读取标准输入中的数字。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--debug",
      "tip": [
        "对无效输入打印警告"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--delimiter",
      "alias": [
        "-d"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-d, --delimiter <X>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "用 X 而不是空白符作为字段分隔符"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--field",
      "usage": [
        "--field <FIELDS>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "替换这些输入字段中的数字（默认 1）；FIELDS 的形式参见下方"
      ],
      "separator": ",",
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--format",
      "usage": [
        "--format <FORMAT>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "使用 printf 风格的浮点 FORMAT；详见下方 FORMAT"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--from",
      "usage": [
        "--from <UNIT>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "把输入数字自动缩放到 UNIT；默认是 'none'；UNIT 的取值参见下方"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "auto"
        },
        {
          "name": "iec"
        },
        {
          "name": "iec-i"
        },
        {
          "name": "none"
        },
        {
          "name": "si"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--from-unit",
      "usage": [
        "--from-unit <N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "指定输入单位的大小（而不是默认的 1）"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--grouping",
      "tip": [
        "使用区域设置定义的分数字符分组，例如 1,000,000（这意味着在 C/POSIX 区域设置下不起作用）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--header",
      "usage": [
        "--header[=N]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "不转换地打印前 N 行表头；未指定时 N 默认为 1"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--invalid",
      "usage": [
        "--invalid <MODE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "无效数字的处理方式：MODE 可以是 abort（默认）、fail、warn、ignore"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "abort"
        },
        {
          "name": "fail"
        },
        {
          "name": "ignore"
        },
        {
          "name": "warn"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--padding",
      "usage": [
        "--padding <N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "把输出填充到 N 个字符；N 为正时右对齐，为负时左对齐；输出宽度超过 N 时忽略填充；默认在遇到空白字符时自动填充"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--round",
      "usage": [
        "--round <METHOD>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "缩放时用 METHOD 舍入；METHOD 可以是 up、down、from-zero（默认）、towards-zero、nearest"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "down"
        },
        {
          "name": "from-zero"
        },
        {
          "name": "nearest"
        },
        {
          "name": "towards-zero"
        },
        {
          "name": "up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--suffix",
      "usage": [
        "--suffix <SUFFIX>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "给输出数字加上 SUFFIX，并接受输入数字中可选的 SUFFIX"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--to",
      "usage": [
        "--to <UNIT>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "把输出数字自动缩放到 UNIT；UNIT 的取值参见下方"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "auto"
        },
        {
          "name": "iec"
        },
        {
          "name": "iec-i"
        },
        {
          "name": "none"
        },
        {
          "name": "si"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--to-unit",
      "usage": [
        "--to-unit <N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "输出单位的大小（而不是默认的 1）"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--zero-terminated",
      "alias": [
        "-z"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-z, --zero-terminated"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "行分隔符为 NUL，而不是换行符"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "tip": [
        "显示此帮助并退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "tip": [
        "输出版本信息并退出"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
